            <span class="badge-grad-year" data-en="Expected: 2028" data-th="สำเร็จการศึกษา: 2571">Expected: 2028</span>
          </div>
          <div class="student-header-title">
            <h3 class="student-name-main" data-en="M.Eng. Bussakorn Bunsri (Reaw)" data-th="บุษกร บุญศรี (เรียว)">M.Eng. Bussakorn Bunsri (Reaw)</h3>
